o the distribution of responses among\nclinical and non-clinical populations.\nWhen administered on a regular basis, longitudinal plots for both the total score and the\nsubscale percentiles provide information about the change in cognitions over time and can be\nused as a positive outcome measure for Trauma Recovery.",
